# concat: concatenate large sequences without hitting depth limit
# This test verifies concat's depth behavior: the lazy PendingBuiltin chain
# allows processing 300 elements without hitting the MAX_EVAL_DEPTH (256) limit.
# Should produce 0..299 in a Dict with integer keys.
[collect [concat [take 200 [range 0]] [take 100 [range 200]]]]
